{"seq":2,"slug":"tokenomics-supply-demand","title":"代币经济学：供需模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/tokenomics-supply-demand","wordCount":1861,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"代币经济学-供需模型\">代币经济学：供需模型</h1><p>加密代币的价格不是凭空产生的——每个代币都嵌入了一套供需结构，由发行计划、销毁机制、锁仓安排和效用需求共同决定均衡价格。代币经济学（tokenomics）的核心问题是：如何设计这些参数，使代币既能引导早期网络启动，又不会在长期稀释持有者价值？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>交换方程（MV=PQ）</strong>：代币流通量 × 流通速度 = 网络经济活动总量，决定代币均衡价格</li>\n<li><strong>流通速度（Velocity）</strong>：代币在单位时间内换手次数，高速度压低代币价格</li>\n<li><strong>代币解锁悬崖（Cliff）</strong>：锁定期结束后一次性释放的大量代币，造成可预测的供给冲击</li>\n<li><strong>NVT 比率</strong>：网络价值/日交易量，加密资产的市盈率类比</li>\n<li><strong>死亡螺旋</strong>：价格下跌→参与者退出→效用降低→价格进一步下跌的正反馈环路</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代币的货币属性与交换方程\">代币的货币属性与交换方程</h2><p>费雪交换方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MV = PQ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 可以改写为加密代币的估值框架。设代币流通量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，流通速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（单位时间内每个代币换手次数），网络经济活动总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（以法币计），则代币单价为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{token} = \\frac{PQ}{M \\cdot V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个框架揭示了代币估值的关键矛盾：<strong>高流通速度压低代币价格</strong>。如果代币仅被用作交换媒介（高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>），持有者不需要囤积，均衡价格低。只有当设计中嵌入<strong>降低流通速度</strong>的机制（质押锁定、治理锁仓、手续费销毁）时，代币才能维持高估值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降低 V 的机制</th>\n<th>代表项目</th>\n<th>经济效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质押锁定</td>\n<td>ETH, SOL, ATOM</td>\n<td>减少流通供给，提供收益率补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理锁仓（veToken）</td>\n<td>CRV, BAL</td>\n<td>锁定时间越长投票权越大，激励长期持有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手续费销毁</td>\n<td>ETH(EIP-1559), BNB</td>\n<td>每笔交易永久减少供给</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效用质押</td>\n<td>LINK(节点质押), GRT</td>\n<td>提供服务需锁定代币作为保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性挖矿锁定</td>\n<td>Uniswap LP, Curve gauge</td>\n<td>将代币锁入协议获取额外激励</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"供给侧-发行计划的设计空间\">供给侧：发行计划的设计空间</h2><p>代币供给模型大致分为三类：</p>\n<p><strong>固定总量递减发行</strong>：比特币模型。总量 2100 万枚，每 210,000 个区块（约 4 年）奖励减半。发行曲线服从几何级数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t) = S_{max} \\cdot (1 - 2^{-t/T_{half}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{max} = 21,000,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{half} = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 年。这创造了「数字黄金」叙事——绝对稀缺性。但问题在于：当区块奖励趋近零，安全预算来源不确定。</p>\n<p><strong>通胀型发行</strong>：以太坊合并后（PoS）的净发行量受质押量调节。基础发行率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>166</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mn>365.25</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{166 \\cdot \\sqrt{S_{total}}}{365.25}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.383em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">365.25</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4383em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">166</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8567em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8167em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1833em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> ETH/天，同时 EIP-1559 的 base fee 燃烧抵消部分发行。网络活跃时可能净通缩，低迷时净通胀。</p>\n<p><strong>预铸 + 解锁</strong>：大多数应用代币的模式。初始全量铸造，按 vesting schedule 逐步释放。典型分配：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"pie\" data-source=\"pie title 典型代币分配结构&#10;    &quot;团队与顾问(15-20%)&quot; : 18&#10;    &quot;投资者(15-25%)&quot; : 20&#10;    &quot;社区激励/生态基金(30-40%)&quot; : 35&#10;    &quot;公开销售(5-15%)&quot; : 10&#10;    &quot;财库储备(10-20%)&quot; : 17\">pie title 典型代币分配结构\n    \"团队与顾问(15-20%)\" : 18\n    \"投资者(15-25%)\" : 20\n    \"社区激励/生态基金(30-40%)\" : 35\n    \"公开销售(5-15%)\" : 10\n    \"财库储备(10-20%)\" : 17</pre><p>解锁悬崖（cliff）和线性释放（linear vesting）的设计直接影响早期价格压力。每次大额解锁（token unlock）前，市场预期会导致提前抛压——这是可预测的供给冲击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"需求侧-代币效用的经济分析\">需求侧：代币效用的经济分析</h2><p>代币的内在需求来自其效用功能。不同效用类型创造不同的需求曲线形状：</p>\n<p><strong>交易手续费需求</strong>：每笔链上交易需消耗代币作为 gas，创造与网络使用量成正比的持续需求。需求函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{gas} = TX_{count} \\cdot avgGas \\cdot gasPrice</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>质押收益需求</strong>：当质押 APR 高于替代资产的机会成本时，理性投资者将买入并质押。均衡质押率满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">APR_{staking} = r_{risk-free} + risk\\_premium</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这创造了利率平价条件——当 DeFi 借贷利率上升超过质押 APR 时，资本从质押流出到 DeFi，反之亦然。</p>\n<p><strong>治理权力需求</strong>：代币赋予持有者对协议参数的投票权，这等价于公司治理中的投票权价值。当协议控制大量经济价值时（如 Uniswap 的 fee switch 潜力），治理权的隐含价值可量化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{governance} = P(fee\\_switch) \\cdot E[annual\\_fees] \\cdot \\frac{token\\_share}{total\\_supply} \\cdot DCF\\_multiplier</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ann</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ees</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"代币设计的博弈论困境\">代币设计的博弈论困境</h2><p>代币经济学面临几个根本性设计矛盾：</p>\n<p><strong>初始分配 vs 去中心化</strong>：项目方需要融资（集中分配给投资者），但网络需要分散持有以保证治理去中心化。高集中度导致寡头治理（参见 <a href=\"../governance-regulation/dao-governance-economics\">DAO 治理经济学</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>通胀激励 vs 持有者价值</strong>：通胀用于奖励参与者（矿工、流动性提供者），但稀释非活跃持有者。设计需在「激励贡献」和「保护投资」间取得平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>流动性 vs 价格稳定</strong>：高流动性方便使用但压低价格（高 V），低流动性支撑价格但阻碍网络效用。锁仓机制是折中方案，但引入流动性风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实证模型-代币估值的-nvt-比率\">实证模型：代币估值的 NVT 比率</h2><p>Network Value to Transactions (NVT) 比率是加密资产的市盈率类比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NVT = \\frac{Network\\_Value}{Daily\\_Transaction\\_Volume}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>高 NVT 意味着网络估值相对于实际经济吞吐量偏高（潜在高估），低 NVT 意味着网络被充分使用（潜在低估或高效）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资产</th>\n<th>典型 NVT 范围</th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BTC</td>\n<td>50-150</td>\n<td>价值存储（低交易频率，高单笔金额）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETH</td>\n<td>20-80</td>\n<td>效用型（DeFi 活跃度驱动交易量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定币</td>\n<td>5-15</td>\n<td>纯交换媒介（极高交易频率）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低流通量新币</td>\n<td>&gt;200</td>\n<td>投机主导，效用未兑现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NVT 的局限在于它无法捕捉 DeFi 中的 TVL（总锁仓价值）效用、治理权价值和期权性（optionality）——这些构成了许多代币估值的主要部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代币经济学的失败模式\">代币经济学的失败模式</h2><p>历史案例揭示了几种常见的代币经济学设计失败：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>死亡螺旋</strong>：代币价格下跌 → 质押/流动性挖矿收益率（以法币计）下降 → 参与者退出 → 网络效用降低 → 代币价格进一步下跌。Terra/LUNA 的崩溃是极端案例</li>\n<li><strong>通胀陷阱</strong>：高通胀激励早期采用，但当激励代币持续解锁而需求增长不足时，卖压超过买入——大多数 DeFi 1.0 治理代币的命运</li>\n<li><strong>巨鲸操控</strong>：初始分配高度集中 + 治理权与持有量绑定 = 少数地址控制协议方向，与去中心化愿景矛盾</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这些供需动力学和设计陷阱，是分析任何加密项目经济可持续性的起点。关于供给侧的物理实现——矿工和验证者如何响应这些经济信号做出资源配置决策——详见 <a href=\"mining-staking-economics\">挖矿与质押经济学</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>代币经济学的核心张力在于：代币同时要承担交换媒介（高流通需求）和价值储存（低流通需求）的功能。降低流通速度的机制（质押、锁仓、燃烧）支撑估值但限制使用；提高流动性促进使用但压低价格。成功的代币设计必须在这两个目标间找到动态平衡，同时避免通胀陷阱、死亡螺旋和巨鲸操控等系统性失败模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代币经济学：供需模型","id":"代币经济学-供需模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代币的货币属性与交换方程","id":"代币的货币属性与交换方程"},{"level":2,"text":"供给侧：发行计划的设计空间","id":"供给侧-发行计划的设计空间"},{"level":2,"text":"需求侧：代币效用的经济分析","id":"需求侧-代币效用的经济分析"},{"level":2,"text":"代币设计的博弈论困境","id":"代币设计的博弈论困境"},{"level":2,"text":"实证模型：代币估值的 NVT 比率","id":"实证模型-代币估值的-nvt-比率"},{"level":2,"text":"代币经济学的失败模式","id":"代币经济学的失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共识机制与激励设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/consensus-incentive-design"},"next":{"title":"挖矿与质押经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/foundations/mining-staking-economics"}}